      "content": "idk i'm just kinda dreading going to the doctor for this lol. it's so expensive and honestly i feel fine when i'm just sitting on the couch. like it's only when i move around. do you think it's really serious? could it just be that my body is still recovering from the virus? i've been taking extra electrolytes and trying to sleep more but nothing seems to help the chest heaviness much.",
